# --- dawnfix (see README.md, "Set up") ---------------------------------
# Changes to the files that decide what Dawnfix may read, run and publish need a review
# from a human owner. Replace @example-org/platform with a real team or user.
# CODEOWNERS only takes effect with "Require review from Code Owners" on the default
# branch (see branch-protection.md). Later lines win, so keep this block at the end.
/.github/                       @example-org/platform
/.dawnfix.yml                 @example-org/platform
/.claude/                       @example-org/platform
/.mcp.json                      @example-org/platform
/CLAUDE.md                      @example-org/platform
/CODEOWNERS                     @example-org/platform
# --- end dawnfix -----------------------------------------------------------
